      "snippet": {
        "line": 146,
        "text": "theorem pressure_moment (hp : ContDiff ℝ ∞ p) (hs : HasCompactSupport p) (hd : ∀ r, deriv p r = g r) : moment 1 p = -(1 / 2 : ℝ) * moment 2 g, with moment n f = ∫ r, r ^ n * f r"
